1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:03,550
Every Seeker came with an address. Nobody writes to it.

2
00:00:04,600 --> 00:00:06,880
Penny Post. A letterbox for your wallet.

3
00:00:07,400 --> 00:00:10,790
One question a day, and everyone who answers shares the pot.

4
00:00:13,300 --> 00:00:16,970
A stranger pays your price to write to you. You keep ninety percent.

5
00:00:18,300 --> 00:00:20,440
Never opened? Their money goes back.

6
00:00:22,600 --> 00:00:25,800
A paid DM is a gate on a chat. This is the post.

7
00:00:27,700 --> 00:00:29,190
The post comes once a day.

8
00:00:31,350 --> 00:00:44,260
This is the real app, running on Solana devnet. No wallet handy? Choose the practice wallet and tap Set me up. One tap puts up a letterbox. Seconds later, today's question and a welcome card land on the doormat.

9
00:00:46,483 --> 00:00:50,433
With your own wallet, every signature goes through Mobile Wallet Adapter.

10
00:00:51,029 --> 00:01:06,769
Every morning there is one card for everyone. Somebody asked every Seeker a question, and put up 300 SKR. I pick an answer and approve once. The program checks my Seeker Genesis Token, so one phone gets one answer. My share so far is 45 SKR.

11
00:01:08,804 --> 00:01:26,774
The next morning, yesterday's result is waiting, and so is my share. There is a new question too. One signature collects yesterday's SKR and answers today's. That is the habit. One tap a day, and it pays. For this scene, the local clock was moved forward a day.

12
00:01:32,063 --> 00:01:49,893
The rest of the post is from people. A stranger paid my price, 10 SKR, to reach me, and their money waits in escrow. I can see who sent it, and nothing else, until I sign for it. The card comes out of its envelope, and 9 SKR is mine. If I had ignored it, their money would have gone back after a week.

13
00:01:53,313 --> 00:02:02,463
Writing back. I write with my finger, pick a stamp, and see what it costs, and when it arrives, before I sign. It is sealed, so only their phone can read it.

14
00:02:09,556 --> 00:02:15,316
I set my own price. And any builder can ask every Seeker tomorrow's question, by putting up the pot.

15
00:02:19,181 --> 00:02:26,841
Penny Post. Live on Solana devnet, and tested against real SKR and real Seeker Genesis Tokens. The post comes once a day.
